   },
   "evidence": "Head store.ts:697 has `const limit = Math.min(opts.limit ?? MAX_FEED_ITEMS, MAX_FEED_ITEMS);` plus limitFeedPage's 16 KiB cap, while FeedQuerySchema still accepts limit up to 1000. The base digest (src/cli/digest.ts) requests `limit: \"1000\"` and runs `if (page.items.length < 1000) break;`. At head, digest.ts is changed to follow hasMore, but the previous release's CLI is not. AGENTS.md requires that an older CLI keep working against a newer daemon."
